 tedtalks  \nLike TED on Facebook:   / ted  \nSubscribe to our channel:    / ted  \n\nTED's videos may be used for non-commercial purposes under a Creative Commons License, Attribution–Non Commercial–No Derivatives (or the CC BY – NC – ND 4.0 International) and in accordance with our TED Talks Usage Policy https://www.ted.com/about/our-organiz.... For more information on using TED for commercial purposes (e.g. employee learning, in a film or online course), please submit a Media Request at https://media-requests.ted.com","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":6,"length":14,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPMBEM2rARgBIhMInoO5mJqglwMVYIqsAh3u_g5fSMW4oYHTyuzgRcoBBJ1U2-Q=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljSF9xV043Si1xY2RaMFp3TjU5WGZCVXxBSTVJdTVzTHp1dTk4Z1ZzR1JsNEhLSUd6NHBQd09LWFB2ZmRwTXkydXlESjFBZklDdWNBSUlIdTFtMktwVnRubnNGVzNEaDVod1hLcnB5VkIzMG84aWpac3JrYUtfdkJWdWZf\u0026q=http%3A%2F%2FTED.com%2F\u0026v=RcGyVTAoXEU","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljSF9xV043Si1xY2RaMFp3TjU5WGZCVXxBSTVJdTVzTHp1dTk4Z1ZzR1JsNEhLSUd6NHBQd09LWFB2ZmRwTXkydXlESjFBZklDdWNBSUlIdTFtMktwVnRubnNGVzNEaDVod1hLcnB5VkIzMG84aWpac3JrYUtfdkJWdWZf\u0026q=http%3A%2F%2FTED.com%2F\u0026v=RcGyVTAoXEU","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":968,"length":14,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPMBEM2rARgBIhMInoO5mJqglwMVYIqsAh3u_g5fSMW4oYHTyuzgRcoBBJ1U2-Q=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUZZTVljRzlRWGlTUEZnTm9qSEJudGg5SVEzSXxBSTVJdTVzTVZlenpCcTdrVEp4X1R4a0R1VWFoR2xPalJZby10OURJMmdJX2dtLVJHS0p3RExTUzlwSTlPcTdmZzNNZllUMDVUQzBIWGc0NUFIMlpiM1hCRjZlV3ZrdExYNjZ0\u0026q=http%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FTEDTalks\u0026v=RcGyVTAoXEU","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN